<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The Sounds window has a Notify box beside each event's sound and flash. Ticking one raises a system notification when that kind of thing happens in a conversation you are not looking at."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_features", "When One Appears")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Only while the tab is in the background")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Only for a conversation that is not the one on screen")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Never for a conversation you have muted")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "One per conversation: a busy room replaces its own notification instead of stacking one per line"
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_features", "What Starts On")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Private messages and mentions of your nickname, because those are the two that are about you. Everything else starts off — notifying on every line of every channel is how the whole thing gets switched off on the first day."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help_features", "Browser Permission")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Your browser decides whether this is possible at all, and it only asks when you click Allow desktop notifications in the Sounds window. If you refuse, the window says so and stops offering: blocked is final until you change it in your browser's own site settings."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-closed-app-notifications">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Notifications With the Chat Closed")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-sounds">{dgettext("help_features", "Sounds")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-mute">{dgettext("help_features", "Mute")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-highlight-words">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Highlight Words")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
